</node>
<node id="image_1__global">
  <data key="d0">Image: image_1</data>
  <data key="d1">ImageEntity</data>
  <data key="d5">image</data>
  <data key="d23">image_1</data>
  <data key="d25">/content/working/images/image_1.jpg</data>
  <data key="d26">1</data>
  <data key="d27">The image shows a single-ear Oetiker-style stepless ear clamp, which is a mechanical fastener used for securing hoses or tubing. The component features a crimpable ear mechanism designed to provide a uniform, 360-degree seal when compressed. There are no visible text labels, part numbers, or annotations in this view.</data>
</node>
<node id="image_10__ear_clamp">
  <data key="d0">Ear Clamp</data>
  <data key="d1">Component</data>
  <data key="d5">image</data>
  <data key="d22">Single ear hose clamp</data>
  <data key="d23">image_10</data>
  <data key="d24">-1</data>
</node>
<node id="image_10__clamp_type">
  <data key="d0">Hose Clamp</data>
  <data key="d1">ComponentType</data>
  <data key="d5">fused</data>
  <data key="d28">Fastener</data>
  <data key="d23">image_10</data>
  <data key="d24">-1</data>
  <data key="d29">step_2</data>
</node>
<node id="image_10__global">
  <data key="d0">Image: image_10</data>
  <data key="d1">ImageEntity</data>
  <data key="d5">image</data>
  <data key="d23">image_10</data>
  <data key="d25">/content/working/images/image_10.jpg</data>
  <data key="d26">1</data>
  <data key="d27">The image displays a single ear, stepless stainless steel hose clamp, commonly used for securing hoses in automotive or industrial fluid systems. The clamp features a mechanical crimp mechanism designed to be compressed with specialized pincers to create a permanent, tamper-resistant seal. There are no visible text labels, part numbers, or annotations in this view.</data>
</node>
