  <data key="d5">image</data>
  <data key="d23">image_11</data>
  <data key="d25">/content/working/images/image_11.jpg</data>
  <data key="d26">1</data>
  <data key="d27">The image displays components for a hose assembly, including a segment of Aeroquip GH134-12 hose, a barbed fitting with a threaded swivel nut, and two metal hose clamps. A separate metal retaining clip is also shown, which is designed to secure the fitting connection. The components are arranged to illustrate the necessary parts for assembling a hydraulic or fluid transfer line.</data>
</node>
