  <data key="d23">image_6</data>
  <data key="d25">/content/working/images/image_6.jpg</data>
  <data key="d26">1</data>
  <data key="d27">This image is a technical reference sheet for the Eaton "EZ Clip" series, displaying a grid of barcodes and corresponding part numbers for various hydraulic hose fittings. Each entry includes a unique alphanumeric part identifier (e.g., FJ3052-1012S) and a brief text description of the fitting type, such as "Straight Male O-Ring" or "45a Female O-Ring Pilot." The components are organized in a structured, tabular layout to facilitate identification and inventory management.</data>
</node>
