<node id="image_7__global">
  <data key="d0">Image: image_7</data>
  <data key="d1">ImageEntity</data>
  <data key="d5">image</data>
  <data key="d23">image_7</data>
  <data key="d25">/content/working/images/image_7.jpg</data>
  <data key="d26">1</data>
  <data key="d27">This image displays a Danfoss E-Z Clip™ Air Conditioning Hose Assembly System kit (FF12139) housed in a partitioned carrying case. The kit includes various sizes of metal cages and clips (sizes -6, -8, -10, and -12), an assembly plier tool with green handles, and a hose cutting tool. An instructional label inside the lid provides a detailed inventory, part numbers for components and O-rings, and a note specifying that the system is designed exclusively for use with Danfoss GH134 and GH134M serie</data>
</node>
