  <data key="d26">1</data>
  <data key="d27">The image shows a partially open, rectangular storage case or container, likely intended for housing tools or components. The object is depicted in a simplified, high-contrast graphical style, showing a hinged lid and a base section. No specific text labels, part numbers, or assembly instructions are visible in this cropped view.</data>
