  <data key="d26">1</data>
  <data key="d27">The image displays components for a hose assembly, including a segment of Aeroquip GH134-12 hose, a metal hose barb fitting with a threaded swivel nut, two hose clamps, and a metal retaining clip. The components are arranged to show the necessary parts for connecting the hose to the fitting, with the clip and clamps serving as the securing mechanism for the barb interface.</data>
